    "created_at": "2016-09-14T17:25:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-14T17:25:59Z",
    "body": "How many implementers are on board with the design and this feature in general?\n\nYou seem to refer to IDL attributes (using `<span>` rather than `<code>`, mistake?) of the object, but what we actually need here is to refer to the internal slots. We don't really want to be invoking code when inspecting the object.\n",
