    "created_at": "2016-09-15T19:04:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T20:09:06Z",
    "body": "I have no objections to this feature. I don't think this is super useful for regular canvas use cases, but I see how it can be very valuable for CSS paint.  For example, for applying 3rd party style tweaks via CSS paint.  I'd rather we not fork CanvasImageSource just for CSS paint, hence +1\nJust needs support from other implementers.\n",
